{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44718","headline":"林公 · 灵一","name":"林公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"支公信高逸，久向山林住。\n时将孙许游，岂以形骸遇。\n幸辞天子诏，复览名臣疏。\n西晋尚虚无，南朝久沦悞。\n因谈老庄意，乃尽逍遥趣。\n谁爲竹林贤，风流相比附。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}